    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      478.39,
      298.21,
      545.73
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      562.39,
      298.2,
      657.73
    ],
    "text": "The boundary for following allotment of land of name and extent depicted in the Advance Tracing No. MR/WLG/2023/396 dated 07.12.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Mirissa South 1 in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 406 of Mirissa South 1 in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Weligama in Matara District in the Southern Province:",
